# core.autocrlf is true on this machine. Without these rules, every checkout
# would rewrite the line endings of the vendored crates, and the SHA-256 digests
# in vendor/PROVENANCE.json would no longer describe the bytes on disk -
# src-tauri/tests/vendor.rs would fail on a clean clone even though nothing had
# actually been tampered with.
vendor/** -text

# The cross-language fixture is bytes a Rust encoder produced. Never convert it.
fixtures/*.bin -text
